        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>幼儿园一日生活安排</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 24px 46px;\n    max-width: 700px;\n  }\n  .continuation {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .role-block {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .role-label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    margin-right: 2px;\n  }\n  .role-content {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n  .list-item {\n    padding-left: 1.4em;\n    text-indent: -1.4em;\n    margin: 1px 0;\n  }\n  .note {\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 1.4em;\n    text-indent: -1.4em;\n    padding-left: 1.4em;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <p class=\"continuation\">学工作。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">教育活动&nbsp;&nbsp;小班9:10－9:50&nbsp;&nbsp;中大班9:10－10:00</div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">主班教师：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.按教学进度有计划地组织教学活动。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">2.活动过程符合《纲要》《指南》精神，注重激发幼儿自主学习、主动学习、结构完整、重难点突出、自然流畅、教学方法灵活、突出学科特点。</div>\n      <div class=\"note\">（注：中大班集体教学活动不得超过25分钟，小班一节体教育活动不超过15分钟，其余为游戏活动。）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">保育员：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.走动、说话声音要轻，不影响幼儿和教师活动。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">2.协助教师对个别需要帮助的幼儿进行适度指导。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">3.活动结束后帮助教师收拾、整理教具。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">10:00-10:10喝水&nbsp;&nbsp;如厕</div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">幼儿：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.根据需要如厕，有序洗手，用自己的水杯按量喝水，不玩水、不洒水。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">主班老师：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.组织幼儿有序如厕、洗手、喝水。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">2.上、下午各组织三次集体喝水，并提醒幼儿随渴随喝。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">保育员：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.组织幼儿有序如厕、洗手、喝水。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">2.保证班上有充足的温开水，上、下午各组织三次集体喝水，并提醒幼儿随渴随喝。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">3.保持桌面、地面干燥洁净。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">10:10-10:40课间操及户外活动</div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">幼儿：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.整理服装，系好鞋带，愉快地参加体育活动。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">2.有秩序地上下楼，不推挤、不打闹。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">3.做操队列整齐，精神饱满，有节奏，有力度。（中大班幼儿会领操）</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">4.熟悉并探究各种各类体育器械的玩法，动作灵活、协调。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">5.遵守游戏规则，有自我保护意识，不追逐打闹、不做危险动作。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">6.根据需要喝水、如厕、整理衣服。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">7.能在较冷、较热户外环境中坚持活动。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"role-block\">\n    <span class=\"role-label\">主班老师：</span>\n    <div class=\"role-content\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\">1.集中整队，清点人数，检查服装、鞋子并进行安全与规则教育。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">2.镜面领操，动作准确到位，观察幼儿做操动作并随语指导。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">4.在自己的视线范围内组织各类活动，集体活动与自由活动相结合，确保每日1小时的体育活动。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">5.能根据幼儿脸色、出汗等情况及时调节活动内容和活动量。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">6.根据天气变化、运动情况和个体需要，及时提醒幼儿增减衣服、饮水、擦汗。</div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\">7.当活动量过大时，请通过徒手操等形式让幼儿的身心得到调[?] [illegible]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
